# Nuggets v2 — Cursor Rules

## What this project is
Greenfield Next.js 15 App Router application replacing a legacy 
MongoDB/Express/Vite app. Stack: Next.js + Supabase (PostgreSQL + Auth) 
+ Vercel + Tailwind CSS.

## Document precedence (when in doubt, consult in this order)
1. NUGGETS_V2_MIGRATION_PLAN.md — Mongo→Postgres field mapping, ETL
2. NUGGETS_V2_BLUEPRINT.md — schema, RSC boundaries, caching, routing
3. NUGGETS_V2_PRODUCT_BEHAVIOR_AND_UI.md — user-visible behavior, copy
4. NUGGETS_V2_BUILD_EXECUTION.md — PR sequence and merge boundaries

---

## ARCHITECTURE RULES

### Server vs Client components
- Default: every page and data loader is a Server Component
- 'use client' only for: pagination scroll sentinel, bookmark toggle, 
  theme toggle, search input, mobile sheet, forms with client validation
- Never: 'use client' on a page that only reads data
- Never: import cookies(), headers(), or server-only modules inside 
  a 'use client' component

### Data fetching
- First page of feed: fetched on server, rendered as HTML
- Pagination: fetch + useTransition — no TanStack Query anywhere
- Bookmarks: one batched GET per feed page (max 24 IDs) — not per card
- Never: useEffect to fetch data that could be a Server Component

### URL state
- stream, tags, q live in URL via nuqs — they are never in useState 
  or context
- nuqs NuqsAdapter mounts in app/(main)/layout.tsx ONLY — never in 
  app/layout.tsx
- Never: useEffect that mirrors searchParams into state

### Routing
- All internal links use next/link — never <a href> for internal routes
- Detail route: /nuggets/[id]/[slug]
- Bookmarks: /bookmarks (auth-gated — redirect to /login if no session)
- Admin: /admin/** (gated by user.app_metadata.is_admin === true)

---

## SCHEMA RULES

### Articles
- status: 'draft' | 'published' only — no is_published column, ever
- published_at: set once on first publish, never recomputed (DB trigger)
- slug: generated at insert as slugify(title) + '-' + id.slice(0,6)
  using scripts/shared/slug.ts — never use the npm slugify package
- search_vector: GENERATED ALWAYS AS STORED — never a trigger or 
  app-written field
- tag_slugs: denormalized text[] — recomputed via SQL on every tag change,
  never from in-memory list

### Never add these columns to articles
- is_published (removed — use status)
- scheduled_for (deferred)
- approval_status, approved_by, approved_at (deferred)  
- access_tier, visibility (deferred)

### Supabase clients
- Browser: lib/supabase/client.ts (createBrowserClient)
- Server: lib/supabase/server.ts (createServerClient + cookies)
- Admin: lib/supabase/admin.ts (service role — has import 'server-only')
- Never: import adminClient from anything except a module with 
  import 'server-only' at the top

