## COMPONENT RULES

### Card component
- ArticleCard is a Server Component shell
- ArticleCardActions (bookmark, share) is a thin 'use client' island
- Bookmark state is local to each card — never lifted to a parent 
  context that wraps the grid
- primary={true} on next/image only for index === 0 card (first card 
  only — set in the Server Component, never in the pagination island)
- No react-markdown in card components

### Admin components
- Admin uses route-level pages: /admin/articles/new, 
  /admin/articles/[id]
- No modal-driven forms in admin — server actions + route pages only
- Confirmation dialogs (unpublish, delete) are the only allowed 
  modals in admin
- react-hook-form allowed in app/admin/** only

### Empty and error states
- All empty/error states use a single <StatusBlock> component
- Never freestyle a one-off empty state layout

