## PERFORMANCE RULES

- Home route JS budget: ~85 KiB gzip max
- Detail route JS budget: ~60 KiB gzip max  
- First paint transfer: ~256 KiB Home / ~192 KiB detail
- LCP target: ≤ 2.5s mobile cold load
- CLS target: ≤ 0.1
- Skeletons required on feed and detail — never blank white, 
  never spinner-only
- Every feed page loads with skeleton-first rendering

---

## NOTIFICATION RULES

- Fan-out recipient query uses LEFT JOIN auth.users with COALESCE 
  defaults — not a direct filter on notification_preferences 
  (users without a row must still receive notifications)
- Synchronous fan-out cap: 5,000 recipients per publish
- Above cap: enqueue via /api/cron/notifications-fanout
- No bell in header for anonymous users
- Notification preferences: lazy-created on first bell open — 
  no seed trigger on signup

---

## SEARCH RULES

- Suggestion debounce: 180ms
- Min query length for suggestions: 2 characters
- Suggestion cap: 8 rows
- q commits on Enter or explicit submit only
- Selecting a suggestion navigates to detail — does not commit q
- Escape closes suggestions, restores input to last committed q
- stream param required on both suggest and search endpoints
- No global cross-stream search

---

## DEFERRED — do not implement these
- In-product draft preview (admins use Supabase Studio)
- Scheduled publish (scheduled_for column)
- Approval workflow
- Push notifications / service worker / PWA
- Sentry (Vercel logs only at launch)
- Dynamic OG images (@vercel/og)
- Public user profiles
- Account deletion
- Avatar uploads
- Custom scroll restoration on Back
- MobileSearchOverlay as separate component (single HeaderSearch expands)
- Collections admin UI (Supabase Studio only until explicit later PR)
- Virtualization (@tanstack/react-virtual)
- AI/GenAI SDK in web app

